OL,3,GNEWSAMan with MND organises sea dip to
OL,4,Araise awareness
OL,5,
OL,6,FMachell says the event is about
OL,7,F"bringing people together, celebrating
OL,8,Flife, and raising as much awareness as
OL,9,Fpossible of this devastating disease".
